               no significant differences in novelty, diversity, integrity, and
               feasibility across different cognitive styles, indicating the
               balancing effect of GenAI on the design outcomes of students with
               different cognitive styles. These findings provide a theoretical
               foundation for further research on GenAI’s impact on students,
               enhance understanding of GenAI’s influence on design processes
