  pages    = "63--91",
  abstract = "A pedagogical framework for design learning and design teaching
              termed Think-Maps is introduced, presented and demonstrated. In
              this framework, domain knowledge becomes explicit as a significant
              component to be taught and transferred in design education. The
              Think-Maps framework proposes that by constructing a conceptual
              map that reflects one’s thinking in a domain, we make explicit the
