  number   =  1,
  pages    = "88--100",
  abstract = "A generative CAD based design exploration method is proposed. It
              is suitable for complex multi-criteria design problems where
              important performance criteria are uncomputable. The method is
              based on building a genotype of the design within a history based
              parametric CAD system and then, varying its parameters randomly
              within pre-defined limits to generate a set of distinctive
              designs. The generated designs are then filtered through various
              constraint envelopes representing geometric viability,
