  publisher = "Elsevier BV",
  volume    = "43-44",
  pages     = "1--16",
  abstract  = "This paper describes the development of a model for classifying
               the different type of ‘design demonstrator’ that might be used in
               translating scientific activity from the laboratory to the
               market. Two detailed case studies are described in which
               designers worked closely with scientists. In one of the projects,
