  author   = "Duncan, John and Assem, Moataz and Shashidhara, Sneha",
  journal  = "Trends in cognitive sciences",
  volume   =  24,
  number   =  10,
  pages    = "838--852",
  abstract = "How does organized cognition arise from distributed brain
              activity? Recent analyses of fluid intelligence suggest a core
              process of cognitive focus and integration, organizing the
              components of a cognitive operation into the required
              computational structure. A cortical 'multiple-demand' (MD) system
