  pages     = "976--991",
  abstract  = "The key prerequisite for experience-driven design is to define
               what experience to design for. User experience (UX) goals
               concretise the intended experience. Based on our own case studies
               from industrial environments and a literature study, we propose
               five different approaches to acquiring insight and inspiration
