               Vision. Each approach brings in a different viewpoint, thus
               supporting the multidisciplinary character of UX. The Brand
               approach ensures that the UX goals are in line with the company's
               brand promise. The Theory approach utilises the available
               scientific knowledge of human behaviour. The Empathy approach
