  number    =  1,
  pages     = "73--86",
  abstract  = "Purpose– The purpose of this action research is to begin to
               assess to what extent organizations have in practice begun to
               make the shift towards triple bottom line (TBL)
               sustainability.Design/methodology/approach– A definition of TBL
               sustainability is provided, and key elements of TBL
