               action research exemplify this dynamic. First, there is a pattern
               of adopting a short‐term focus and expediency in decision making.
               Second, problem solving favors the “quick fix” over thoughtful
               consideration and development of the key components for
               sustainability. The research may also lead to questioning the
               urgency of implementing the very complex systemic TBL
               sustainability at this time in view of widespread climate
               concerns, versus concentrating on the more straightforward carbon
               footprint reduction.Research limitations/implications– A major
               implication is the pressing need to clearly define sustainability
