  journal   = "Journal of knowledge management",
  publisher = "Emerald",
  volume    =  29,
  number    =  11,
  pages     = "32--58",
  abstract  = "Purpose Design thinking is widely recognized as an effective
               problem-solving approach in the professional and academic world,
               albeit with varying interpretations. It has been studied in
               multiple forms – as a tool, a practice, a skill and a mindset –
               leading to ongoing debates about its fundamental nature. This
               study aims to explore the use of design thinking in practice and
