               knowledge, this study is one of the first large-scale
               quantitative analyses of the nature of design thinking in action,
               providing a solid foundation for future research on design
               thinking.",
  month     =  "15~" # jan,
  year      =  2025,
  url       = "http://dx.doi.org/10.1108/jkm-04-2024-0424",
