  volume    =  11,
  number    =  3,
  pages     = "195--209",
  abstract  = "Abstract: Most computer‐based design tools assume that designers
               work with a well‐defined problem. However, this assumption has
               been challenged by current research. The explorative aspect of
               design, especially during conceptual design, is not fully
               addressed. This paper introduces a model for problem‐design
