               Computing Systems",
  publisher = "Association for Computing Machinery",
  address   = "New York, NY, USA",
  number    = "Article 219",
  pages     = "1--8",
  abstract  = "Artificial Intelligence (AI) will provide novel User Experience
               (UX) solutions if UX designers understand how AI can be best
               utilized. They need to understand AI capabilities and envisage
               potential applications. To aid the ideation processes, design
               heuristics for AI are needed to support UX designers in the
               conceptual design stage. Forty design heuristics were extracted
               from 1,755 granted AI patents through a four-step process. The
               feasibility of the heuristics was verified with two AI-powered
