  pages     = "67--72",
  abstract  = "In this work, we provide a technique for efficiently exploring a
               parameterized system-on-a-chip (SoC) architecture to find all
               Pareto-optimal configurations in a multi-objective design space.
               Globally, our approach uses a parameter dependency model of our
               target parameterized SoC architecture to extensively prune
