  number    = "1-2",
  pages     = "37--45",
  abstract  = "In this article, the problem of understanding multiple layers of
               complexity in our universe is addressed, with particular emphasis
               on explaining creative evolutions in the material, biological,
               and psycho-social layers. Perspectives from physics, biology,
