              governance principles and adopt forms of inclusive policy-making
              to ensure the actionability of ethical and responsibility
              principles in the successful governance of AI development and use.
              By combining the results, we propose a CIIA (Comprehensive,
              Inclusive, Institutionalized, and Actionable) framework that
              integrates the key aspects of the proposed development solutions
              into an ideal typical and comprehensive model for AI governance.",
  year     =  2022,
  url      = "https://www.frontiersin.org/articles/10.3389/fhumd.2022.858108",
