               design for additive manufacturing (DfAM) method available, nor
               are all the impacts and constraints on the product and
               development process known. Therefore, a method to redesign
               existing products for AM is proposed. It consists of functional
               decomposition enhanced by constraints identification, and
               analyses of the impact on the design space. Furthermore, the
               approach defines a coupling of function and geometry models to
